# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Not cosmetic. Story files are asserted to round-trip byte-identically, so that
# an AI-proposed patch lands as a minimal diff instead of rewriting the file. On
# Windows, core.autocrlf=true hands the working tree CRLF while dump_story emits
# LF, which fails that assertion on a fresh clone - the whole suite goes red for
# anyone who clones the repo on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.webm binary
*.wav  binary
*.mp3  binary
